    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any jungles.\n\nSwiftfern is a slender emerald fern whose divided fronds twitch whenever air moves around them. Even on a still day its leaves seem to lean towards the quickest route through nearby growth, a habit jungle guides use to identify hidden game trails. Its prepared sap is rubbed into the calves and soles, where it produces a restless tingling and lightness of step. For 5 minutes, you gain a +5-foot item bonus to Speed.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
